XB-Kidux-Name-en: Step
XB-Kidux-Description-en: A physics playground: put springs, weights and forces on the table, press play and see what happens.
XB-Kidux-Name-es: Step
XB-Kidux-Description-es: Un laboratorio de física: pon muelles, pesos y fuerzas sobre la mesa, dale a reproducir y mira qué pasa.
XB-Kidux-Ages: 10-16
XB-Kidux-Before: simulations
Description: Kidux learning module: Step, a physics playground for ages ten and up
 Kidux is a Debian derivative for a child's first computer. This learning
 module is Step: a child puts bodies, springs, ropes and forces on a plane,
 presses play and watches what happens, with meters and graphs to read it,
 in the child's language and without the internet.
 .
 Once it is installed, an adult switches it on for each child on the
 Modules page of the adult panel.
